1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,811
At year end the office opens Promotion and creates the next academic year.

2
00:00:03,811 --> 00:00:11,990
One view: who is ready, who needs review, and the new admissions waiting for a seat.

3
00:00:11,990 --> 00:00:16,793
Plan Class 7 — last year’s Class 6 students and the new admissions, together.

4
00:00:16,793 --> 00:00:19,009
Students who failed are unticked automatically. Untick anyone else to hold them back.

5
00:00:19,009 --> 00:00:22,841
Set how many students each section should hold.

6
00:00:22,841 --> 00:00:26,289
Need more room? Add a new section.

7
00:00:26,289 --> 00:00:33,162
Fill the sections in order — and adjust any student by hand.

8
00:00:33,162 --> 00:00:36,546
Confirm: everyone is enrolled in 2027 with a roll number.

9
00:00:36,546 --> 00:00:39,159
The overview updates — sections show their new head counts.

10
00:00:39,159 --> 00:00:42,162
Students left out wait under “Not promoted yet”.

11
00:00:42,162 --> 00:00:47,957
Promote a held-back student later, into any section with a free seat.

12
00:00:47,957 --> 00:00:55,944
Or keep them in their current class for another year.

13
00:00:55,944 --> 00:01:00,136
Every seat accounted for — ready for the new session.
